    731.7
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 8,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 208.2,
   "source_y": 712.0,
   "text": "八月初六日。潘金蓮為武大百日燒靈。準備下嫁。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1682,
   "col": [
    162.8,
    286.2,
    184.7,
    637.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 9,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 173.8,
   "source_y": 617.5,
   "text": "八月初八日。娶潘金蓮過門為第五妾。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1683,
   "col": [
    441.4,
    242.8,
    463.9,
    533.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 9,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 454.0,
   "source_y": 515.0,
   "text": "子樓，誤打李外傳。吃上官司。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1683,
   "col": [
    340.5,
    248.2,
    361.6,
    398.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 10,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 351.2,
   "source_y": 380.0,
   "text": "孟州充軍。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1683,
   "col": [
    271.4,
    242.8,
    293.3,
    439.0
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 10,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 282.2,
   "source_y": 420.0,
   "text": "李瓶兒派人送花來。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1683,
   "col": [
    201.7,
    282.9,
    223.5,
    534.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 10,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 213.5,
   "source_y": 516.5,
   "text": "九月間。西門慶收用春梅。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "col": [
    539.4,
    258.0,
    564.7,
    720.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 11,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 553.5,
   "source_y": 700.5,
   "text": "。跟著孫雪娥數數落落，被潘金蓮聽見，鬥嘴鬥氣。11"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "col": [
    441.4,
    258.0,
    467.4,
    778.3
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 11,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 454.5,
   "source_y": 757.5,
   "text": "，拏到院中打頭面做衣服定桌席，吹彈歌舞，做三日喜酒。11"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "col": [
    341.9,
    251.5,
    366.6,
    527.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 12,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 354.8,
   "source_y": 507.5,
   "text": "起來，向漢子檢舉這件醜事。12"
  },
  {
   "page": 1685,
   "col": [
    219.2,
    236.3,
    246.8,
    416.2
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 14,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 233.5,
   "source_y": 396.0,
   "text": "墙頭上舖苦毡條。14"
  },
  {
   "page": 1686,
   "col": [
    82.5,
    239.6,
    105.0,
    643.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 14,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 94.2,
   "source_y": 623.5,
   "text": "，與潘金蓮現住三間樓房相連，連成一條邊。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "col": [
    363.1,
    232.0,
    390.6,
