  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "col": [
    136.1,
    242.8,
    162.8,
    516.0
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 148.5,
   "source_y": 497.0,
   "text": "問罪，既夾又打，一氣身亡。27"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "col": [
    630.2,
    237.4,
    652.9,
    393.5
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 641.5,
   "source_y": 374.5,
   "text": "辰日上京拜壽。27"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "col": [
    597.1,
    274.2,
    619.7,
    778.3
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 608.2,
   "source_y": 758.5,
   "text": "五月二十八日。來保與吳主管押送蔡太師生辰擔去東京。27"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "col": [
    333.4,
    275.4,
    356.0,
    817.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 344.2,
   "source_y": 797.5,
   "text": "六月初一日。西門慶在花園翡翠軒捲棚下，與妻妾婢女淫樂。27"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "col": [
    621.1,
    243.9,
    642.2,
    533.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 631.8,
   "source_y": 515.5,
   "text": "念薦來十四歲小廝，取名棋童。31"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "col": [
    588.6,
    285.1,
    610.5,
    785.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 598.8,
   "source_y": 767.0,
   "text": "六月下旬。夏提刑送來十二名排軍答應；同僚具公禮賀。31"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "col": [
    523.1,
    245.0,
    543.5,
    362.1
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 533.2,
   "source_y": 344.5,
   "text": "日晚始散。31"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "col": [
    456.1,
    243.9,
    478.7,
    846.6
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 468.2,
   "source_y": 826.5,
   "text": "喬大戶家成房子。上房丫頭玉簫，暗送酒菜與琴童。鬧成失壺紛擾。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "col": [
    554.9,
    255.8,
    580.2,
    431.4
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 569.5,
   "source_y": 412.5,
   "text": "不給，罰唱小曲。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "col": [
    195.3,
    252.6,
    216.4,
    407.6
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 37,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 206.5,
   "source_y": 389.5,
   "text": "十五歲，屬馬。37"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "col": [
    129.0,
    289.4,
    151.6,
    1002.7
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 37,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 140.8,
   "source_y": 984.0,
   "text": "九月中旬。（私通王六兒的翌日）兌銀四兩，買丫頭一名給王六兒使喚，名錦兒。37"
  },
  {
   "page": 1699,
   "col": [
    446.9,
    289.4,
    470.2,
    834.7
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 39,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 459.8,
   "source_y": 813.0,
   "text": "正月初九日晚。爲潘金蓮生日擺酒。酒罷，聽兩位姑子說經。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1699,
   "col": [
    153.0,
    252.6,
    174.2,
    562.6
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 41,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 164.0,
   "source_y": 543.0,
   "text": "酒觀燈。奶子抱著官哥也跟去了。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1699,
   "col": [
    86.7,
    252.6,
    108.5,
    561.5
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 41,
   "situation": 2,
   "source_x": 98.5,
   "source_y": 543.0,
   "text": "大姐，各裁三件，春梅多裁兩件。"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "col": [
    154.4,
    236.3,
    177.7,
    836.9
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 166.8,
   "source_y": 817.0,
   "text": "正杭州府趙大尹霆，訂初九日赴會，業已發束。主家備有五席戲子。77"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "col": [
    122.0,
    275.4,
    144.5,
    664.5
   ],
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 133.2,
   "source_y": 645.5,
   "text": "十二月七日。潘金蓮管賬刻薄，小廝怨罵。77"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 11,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 467.4,
   "source_y": 778.3,
   "text": "，拏到院中打頭面做衣服定桌席，吹彈歌舞，做三日喜酒。11",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 12,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 366.6,
   "source_y": 527.9,
   "text": "起來，向漢子檢舉這件醜事。12",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1684,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 12,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 235.4,
   "source_y": 645.0,
   "text": "經孟玉樓與春梅從中打了圓場，遮掩過了。12",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1685,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 13,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 380.0,
   "source_y": 550.6,
   "text": "。這年，李瓶兒二十三歲，屬羊。13",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1685,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 14,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 246.8,
   "source_y": 416.2,
   "text": "墙頭上舖苦毡條。14",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1685,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 14,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 146.7,
   "source_y": 513.8,
   "text": "三人，别項銀兩，不准追了。14",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1686,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 14,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 572.5,
   "source_y": 276.4,
   "text": "14",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1687,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 15,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 659.2,
   "source_y": 428.2,
   "text": "燈人，指指說說。15",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1687,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 16,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 429.4,
   "source_y": 940.9,
   "text": "來蓋房子，並要求西門慶娶她，還要求把她嫁過去的住處，蓋在潘金蓮一連邊。16",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1687,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 16,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 294.7,
   "source_y": 446.6,
   "text": "西門慶湊起蓋房子。16",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1687,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 16,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 193.9,
   "source_y": 737.1,
   "text": "五月端午節。李瓶兒請西門慶來家解粽（過節）。16",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 18,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 655.0,
   "source_y": 890.0,
   "text": "七月中旬。陳經濟初次見到潘金蓮，猛然一見，心蕩目搖，魂魄已失。18",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 19,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 555.5,
   "source_y": 872.6,
   "text": "八月初旬。西門家衆婦女遊賞新花園，陳經濟與潘金蓮撲蝴蝶遊戲。19",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 19,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 324.3,
   "source_y": 872.6,
   "text": "僱了五六付扛擔，把獅子街的物件，抬運到西門慶家，都堆在花樓上。19",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 19,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 257.3,
   "source_y": 604.9,
   "text": "八月二十二日夜。李瓶兒上吊尋死。19",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 19,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 223.5,
   "source_y": 623.3,
   "text": "八月二十三日晚。西門慶鞭打李瓶兒。19",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 20,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 191.1,
   "source_y": 910.5,
   "text": "八月二十三日晚。孟玉樓、潘金蓮等人，議論西門慶鞭打李瓶兒的情況。20",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1689,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 20,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 158.6,
   "source_y": 720.9,
   "text": "八月二十三日。孟玉樓規勸吳月娘與西門慶和好。20",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1690,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 20,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 602.8,
   "source_y": 948.5,
   "text": "李瓶兒出見衆賓客，凡歌女小廝都有封賞。月娘見到衆人趨奉李瓶兒，甚是不快。20",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1690,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 20,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 502.6,
   "source_y": 794.5,
   "text": "敎演彈唱。春梅學琵琶，玉簫學筝，迎春學弦子，蘭香學胡琴。20",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1690,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 20,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 268.6,
   "source_y": 811.9,
   "text": "女們及嫖客丁二官等人，拴縛在門房內。多虧應伯爵等人勸住了。20",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 576.7,
   "source_y": 860.7,
   "text": "早在十一月半頭，便派往杭州爲蔡太師買辦生辰擔去了，要半年期程。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 475.9,
   "source_y": 459.6,
   "text": "，大罵賊王八調戲她。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 23,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 375.8,
   "source_y": 975.6,
   "text": "新正佳節。潘金蓮、孟玉樓在李瓶兒房中下棋賭輸赢，買豬頭要來旺媳婦熟燒。23",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 23,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 244.7,
   "source_y": 380.5,
   "text": "，懊恨歸房。23",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 23,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 178.3,
   "source_y": 492.1,
   "text": "在金蓮房中把小意兒貼戀。23",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1691,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 24,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 145.2,
   "source_y": 1003.8,
   "text": "正月十六日。西門慶合家歡度燈節。婦女走百病，金蓮經濟調情，來旺媳婦套穿金蓮鞋。24",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 24,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 626.8,
   "source_y": 403.2,
   "text": "，罵來旺媳婦。24",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 25,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 561.9,
   "source_y": 961.5,
   "text": "千。來旺從杭州買辦壽禮回來。孫雪娥透露來旺媳婦私通主人事。來旺追問妻子。25",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 25,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 497.0,
   "source_y": 345.8,
   "text": "二千兩。25",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 26,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 297.5,
   "source_y": 498.6,
   "text": "提刑所獄。判遞原籍徐州。26",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 26,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 229.1,
   "source_y": 402.1,
   "text": "。亡年廿五歲。26",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1692,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 162.8,
   "source_y": 516.0,
   "text": "問罪，既夾又打，一氣身亡。27",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 652.9,
   "source_y": 393.5,
   "text": "辰日上京拜壽。27",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 619.7,
   "source_y": 778.3,
   "text": "五月二十八日。來保與吳主管押送蔡太師生辰擔去東京。27",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 27,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 356.0,
   "source_y": 817.4,
   "text": "六月初一日。西門慶在花園翡翠軒捲棚下，與妻妾婢女淫樂。27",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 28,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 255.9,
   "source_y": 353.4,
   "text": "疼子罵主。28",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1693,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 29,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 223.5,
   "source_y": 856.4,
   "text": "六月三日。潘金蓮唆使西門慶趕來昭一家三口到獅子街看守房屋。29",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 642.2,
   "source_y": 533.4,
   "text": "念薦來十四歲小廝，取名棋童。31",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 610.5,
   "source_y": 785.9,
   "text": "六月下旬。夏提刑送來十二名排軍答應；同僚具公禮賀。31",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 543.5,
   "source_y": 362.1,
   "text": "日晚始散。31",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 31,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 446.2,
   "source_y": 633.0,
   "text": "七月二十二日。請官家吃官哥滿月酒。31",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 379.3,
   "source_y": 632.0,
   "text": "七月下旬。李桂姐拜認吳月娘作乾娘。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 347.6,
   "source_y": 977.8,
   "text": "七月下旬。潘金蓮抱官哥出來，舉得高高的。從此官哥驚哭不停，漾奶睡不穩。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 281.3,
   "source_y": 882.4,
   "text": "，着來保尋夥計，在獅子街開絨線舖。應伯爵介紹夥計韓道國協助來保。33",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 212.2,
   "source_y": 323.1,
   "text": "曲兒。33",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 180.5,
   "source_y": 729.5,
   "text": "。八月十五日晚。李瓶兒推西門慶去金蓮房中歇宿。33",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1695,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 114.2,
   "source_y": 824.9,
   "text": "了一千二百兩銀子，在東大街新買一所，門面七間，到底五層。）)33",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 33,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 449.8,
   "source_y": 354.4,
   "text": "早送官。33",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 34,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 415.9,
   "source_y": 930.0,
   "text": "。八月中旬。韓道國央請應伯爵求西門慶爲他說人情，不使婦人送官丢醜。34",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 4,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 283.4,
   "source_y": 949.6,
   "text": "兄湊銀，央請應伯爵代爲求請開脫。書童轉求李瓶兒攬事說情。西門慶私書童。4",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 34,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 216.4,
   "source_y": 508.4,
   "text": "童受賄託李瓶兒求請說事。34",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 35,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 150.2,
   "source_y": 909.5,
   "text": "欺他。西門慶借未能阻住白來搶入內爲由痛打平安。畫童在旁也陪了一拶。35",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1696,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 35,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 84.6,
   "source_y": 642.8,
   "text": "三日。西門慶宴留韓道國。書童扮旦唱曲。35",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 35,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 616.1,
   "source_y": 851.0,
   "text": "八月廿四日。賁四報告墳庄工事。建議購下向皇親庄子一部分。35",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 35,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 549.2,
   "source_y": 503.0,
   "text": "李瓶兒轎去了。月娘快快。35",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 35,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 481.5,
   "source_y": 328.4,
   "text": "粉說。35",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 36,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 417.4,
   "source_y": 984.2,
   "text": "色女子事。並告知蔡太師假子新狀元蔡（蘊）一泉回籍省親，道經清河，希留一飯。36",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 36,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 284.1,
   "source_y": 522.5,
   "text": "一端，合香三百，白金卅兩。36",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 37,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 216.4,
   "source_y": 407.6,
   "text": "十五歲，屬馬。37",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 37,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 184.7,
   "source_y": 983.2,
   "text": "九月十五日前後。西門慶私通韓道國媳婦王六兒。這年，王六兒廿九歲，屬蛇。37",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 37,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 151.6,
   "source_y": 1002.7,
   "text": "九月中旬。（私通王六兒的翌日）兌銀四兩，買丫頭一名給王六兒使喚，名錦兒。37",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1697,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 38,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 83.9,
   "source_y": 350.1,
   "text": "天來取。38",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 88,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 612.6,
   "source_y": 996.2,
   "text": "九月中旬。韓二搗鬼吃醋，向王六兒撒野。西門慶軍刑緝捕到提刑所，夾打制服。88",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 38,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 542.9,
   "source_y": 420.6,
   "text": "與翟謙親家相稱。38",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 38,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 512.5,
   "source_y": 806.5,
   "text": "十月中旬。夏提刑備酒叫唱，宴請西門慶，答謝送馬之情。38",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 38,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 343.4,
   "source_y": 458.6,
   "text": "去和諧，夜宿金蓮處。38",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 99,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 277.1,
   "source_y": 920.3,
   "text": "所門面兩間到底四層房屋。從此韓道國只在鋪中上宿，敎老婆陪西門慶玩耍。99",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 39,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 210.8,
   "source_y": 653.6,
   "text": "醮。並打算把官哥寄在三寶座下，討個外名。39",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1698,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 39,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 110.0,
   "source_y": 611.4,
   "text": "正月初八日。向吳道官送官哥寄名禮。39",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1701,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 45,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 284.1,
   "source_y": 286.2,
   "text": "45",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 46,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 457.6,
   "source_y": 293.8,
   "text": "46",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 46,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 426.5,
   "source_y": 680.8,
   "text": "正月十七日。月娘、玉樓、瓶兒卜龜兒卦。46",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 47,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 292.6,
   "source_y": 506.2,
   "text": "百兩。開放了苗青回揚州。47",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 48,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 225.6,
   "source_y": 390.2,
   "text": "。有意破案。48",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 48,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 193.9,
   "source_y": 985.4,
   "text": "二月中旬。韓道國賄得苗青金銀，買婢女，蓋樓房，爲子捐入武學。一時暄赫。48",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 48,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 126.2,
   "source_y": 506.2,
   "text": "祝墳庄新蓋山子捲棚房屋。48",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1702,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 48,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 93.0,
   "source_y": 622.2,
   "text": "三月初六日。鑼鼓喧闐，官哥受驚。48",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1704,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 49,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 217.2,
   "source_y": 288.4,
   "text": "49",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1705,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 50,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 642.2,
   "source_y": 288.4,
   "text": "50",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 51,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 614.0,
   "source_y": 601.6,
   "text": "邀西門慶廿一日去劉老太監庄上一敍。51",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 51,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 580.9,
   "source_y": 814.1,
   "text": "四月廿日。月娘與婦女，聽姑子們講說佛法，演頌金剛科。51",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 51,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 512.5,
   "source_y": 352.3,
   "text": "一部。)51",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 51,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 480.8,
   "source_y": 946.4,
   "text": "。）四月廿日。李瓶兒、潘金蓮要陳經濟買銷金汗巾兒，李瓶兒出銀一兩九錢。51",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 51,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 446.9,
   "source_y": 738.2,
   "text": "四月廿日。徐四家欠銀應允後天歸還二百五十兩。51",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1706,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 52,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 346.1,
   "source_y": 641.8,
   "text": "四月廿一日。李桂姐仍在西門家隱藏。52",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1712,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 10,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 579.5,
   "source_y": 848.8,
   "text": "九月六日。李瓶兒傷心病體不能接侍漢子。推漢子去潘六兒處。10",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1712,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 61,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 546.4,
   "source_y": 617.9,
   "text": "九月初六日。潘金蓮處再試胡僧藥。61",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1712,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 61,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 512.5,
   "source_y": 675.4,
   "text": "九月初九日。慶重陽賞菊，接申二姐獻唱。61",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1712,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 61,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 445.6,
   "source_y": 310.0,
   "text": "工。61",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1712,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 61,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 379.3,
   "source_y": 365.3,
   "text": "老人診治。61",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1713,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 63,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 389.1,
   "source_y": 287.2,
   "text": "。63",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1714,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 7,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 200.9,
   "source_y": 746.9,
   "text": "十月廿日。拆靈棚。準備銀兩，南方辦貨。天大雪。7",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1715,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 67,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 677.5,
   "source_y": 589.7,
   "text": "十月廿七日。西門慶夢見李瓶兒。67",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1715,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 67,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 550.6,
   "source_y": 801.1,
   "text": "十月廿七日。孟玉樓攜兄弟孟二辭行，要去川廣販買香蠟。67",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 595.0,
   "source_y": 995.1,
   "text": "十一月初十日。抄來陞官邸報，西門慶陞任掌刑正千戶，夏提刑調指揮司管鹵薄。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 528.8,
   "source_y": 494.3,
   "text": "趕冬至令節見朝引奏謝恩。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 494.9,
   "source_y": 710.0,
   "text": "十一月十二日。西門慶等人由清河起程赴東京。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 462.5,
   "source_y": 995.1,
   "text": "十一月廿三日抵東京。陪夏提刑見崔中書。當晚西門慶與夏提刑住在崔中書府第。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 394.8,
   "source_y": 552.9,
   "text": "區主祭未歸。差黃四鴻臚寺報名。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 262.2,
   "source_y": 417.4,
   "text": "一千五百兩出手。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 194.6,
   "source_y": 593.0,
   "text": "到堂同衆領筍付。當晚宿崔中書府第。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1716,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 70,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 95.2,
   "source_y": 532.2,
   "text": "當晚住何千戶家。夜夢李瓶兒。70",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 487.9,
   "source_y": 557.2,
   "text": "處關說，希望舉劾有好成績升轉。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 454.8,
   "source_y": 637.4,
   "text": "十一月廿八日。春梅恃寵厲罵申二姐。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 386.4,
   "source_y": 406.5,
   "text": "封（二百兩）。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 319.4,
   "source_y": 347.9,
   "text": "嬌施嗔。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 286.2,
   "source_y": 754.5,
   "text": "。十一月廿九日。爲春梅罵申二姐事，月娘金蓮頂嘴。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 253.1,
   "source_y": 754.5,
   "text": "十一月廿九日。西門慶宿上房，潘金蓮誤了壬子日。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1720,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 75,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 186.1,
   "source_y": 774.0,
   "text": "十一月三十日。孟玉樓慫恿潘金蓮陪禮，解慍吳月娘。75",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 640.1,
   "source_y": 759.9,
   "text": "十二月一日。西門家出入銀錢眼目，改由潘金蓮經管。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 608.4,
   "source_y": 984.2,
   "text": "十二月一日。本縣衙差人送來新暦日二百五十本，開年改了重和元年；該閏正月。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 474.4,
   "source_y": 544.1,
   "text": "十二月一日。春梅賭氣絕食。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 442.1,
   "source_y": 833.6,
   "text": "十二月二日。何九兄弟何十受盜案牽連，王婆央求西門慶說項。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 409.6,
   "source_y": 796.8,
   "text": "十二月三日。西門慶開放何十，另拿弘化寺一名和尚頂缺。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 377.2,
   "source_y": 907.3,
   "text": "十二月四日。雲裏守新襲山東清河右衛指揮同知，具送土儀致謝西門慶。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 343.4,
   "source_y": 853.1,
   "text": "十二月五日。賁四攜夏龍溪書信，請假護送長姐赴京。初六起程。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 310.2,
   "source_y": 681.9,
   "text": "十二月五日。溫秀才品行不端，趕出西門府。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 243.2,
   "source_y": 315.4,
   "text": "贐禮。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 177.7,
   "source_y": 836.9,
   "text": "正杭州府趙大尹霆，訂初九日赴會，業已發束。主家備有五席戲子。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 144.5,
   "source_y": 664.5,
   "text": "十二月七日。潘金蓮管賬刻薄，小廝怨罵。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1721,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 110.7,
   "source_y": 740.4,
   "text": "十二月初七日。清河夏家房屋騰空。何九送禮致謝。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 598.5,
   "source_y": 311.1,
   "text": "事。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 566.1,
   "source_y": 678.6,
   "text": "。十二月廿七日。西門慶一一打發各家年禮。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 533.0,
   "source_y": 619.0,
   "text": "十二月三十日。大年夜，闔家慶年。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 399.8,
   "source_y": 560.5,
   "text": "亦有私，西門慶走後，玳安留宿。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 76,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 367.3,
   "source_y": 813.0,
   "text": "正月初三日。吳大舅來拜，暢談屯田所說制及秤稱斛斗事。76",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 334.1,
   "source_y": 717.6,
   "text": "正月初四日。西門慶等人去雲裏守家吃慶官酒。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 301.1,
   "source_y": 888.9,
   "text": "正月初六日。西門慶赴林太太約。吳月娘誇美何千戶娘子年輕貌美。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 267.2,
   "source_y": 755.5,
   "text": "正月初七日。吳月娘等婦女四人，去雲裏守家宴飲。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 200.2,
   "source_y": 717.6,
   "text": "正月初七日。與吳月娘商各家女眷燈節來觀燈。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 132.6,
   "source_y": 311.1,
   "text": "孝。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1723,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 100.1,
   "source_y": 794.5,
   "text": "。正月初八日。荊忠升任東南統制兼督漕運總兵官來拜謝。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1724,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 584.5,
   "source_y": 718.7,
   "text": "正月初十日。賁四由京返家，指揮花匠紮煙火。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1724,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 78,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 316.6,
   "source_y": 924.6,
   "text": "正月十二日。晚夕尙未起更，西門慶已感精神不繼。酒席上便齁齁入睡。78",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1724,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 248.8,
   "source_y": 717.6,
   "text": "正月十三日。王六兒剪贈青絲裝成同心結拴托。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1724,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 114.9,
   "source_y": 925.8,
   "text": "。下馬後腿軟不能走。潘金蓮又強西門慶再試胡僧藥。淫欲過度。脫陽病倒。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1724,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 81.8,
   "source_y": 852.0,
   "text": "正月十四日。西門慶梳頭暈倒。吳月娘作主取銷十五日宴客事。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1725,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 650.0,
   "source_y": 774.0,
   "text": "正月十六日。醫藥無效，遷出金蓮房住入上房月娘處。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1725,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 617.6,
   "source_y": 580.0,
   "text": "正月十九日。西門慶交代後事。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1725,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 191.1,
   "source_y": 752.3,
   "text": "正月廿一日五更時分。西門慶氣絕。亡年三十三歲。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1725,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 158.6,
   "source_y": 829.2,
   "text": "正月廿一日。吳月娘產子。李嬌兒趁忙亂暗取五錠元寶回屋。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1726,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 612.6,
   "source_y": 640.6,
   "text": "鴻帶批文回。李智黃四路上賄賂來爵春鴻。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1726,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 79,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 511.1,
   "source_y": 407.6,
   "text": "往張二官合夥。79",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1727,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 61,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 648.6,
   "source_y": 749.0,
   "text": "三月初九日。西門慶斷七，吳月娘與婦人上墳燒紙。61",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1727,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 81,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 582.4,
   "source_y": 513.8,
   "text": "來保將玉簫與迎春二人送去。81",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1727,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 81,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 549.2,
   "source_y": 804.4,
   "text": "四月間。來保惠祥夫婦離開西門家，與妻弟劉倉開設布店。81",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1728,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 83,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 551.3,
   "source_y": 346.9,
   "text": "菊覷見。83",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1728,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 83,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 518.1,
   "source_y": 943.1,
   "text": "。八月十八日，晨。秋菊把昨晚所見，告知月娘。月娘喝退秋菊；大姐犯疑。83",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1728,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 84,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 484.4,
   "source_y": 580.0,
   "text": "九月十六日。吳月娘泰山燒香。84",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1728,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 84,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 384.9,
   "source_y": 846.6,
   "text": "九月中旬。吳月娘歸途遇雪洞禪師，示以十五年後度孝哥出家。84",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1728,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 85,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 251.7,
   "source_y": 848.8,
   "text": "十月初旬。吳月娘泰山進香返抵家。勞頓驚駭，身體不適數日。85",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1729,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 7,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 215.1,
   "source_y": 901.9,
   "text": "十二月上旬。應伯爵路上唆使春鴻改投張二官家。被張二官要得去了。7",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1729,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 181.2,
   "source_y": 712.2,
   "text": "十二月上旬。雲裏守有女與月娘孝哥割襟成親。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1729,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 77,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 114.2,
   "source_y": 555.0,
   "text": "張勝李安還價八十兩，未能成交。77",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1734,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 598.5,
   "source_y": 466.1,
   "text": "情，開釋陳經濟主僕。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1734,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 497.0,
   "source_y": 331.7,
   "text": "清河。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1734,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 464.6,
   "source_y": 680.8,
   "text": "。某月日。（應爲十月間。）陳經濟返抵家。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1734,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 22,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 162.8,
   "source_y": 525.8,
   "text": "。具結不得再向西門氏騷擾。22",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1735,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 94,
   "situation": 1,
   "source_x": 153.7,
   "source_y": 653.6,
   "text": "她坐大，怒打孫雪娥，喊薛嫂領出賣入娼門。94",
   "how": "ring_digit"
  },
  {
   "page": 1736,
   "class": "ring",
   "number": 94,
   "situation": 1,
